Shelter Categories
The following table summarizes the number of shelters in each category.

category_table &lt;- shelters |&gt;
  count(CATEGORY, name = "Number of Shelters") |&gt;
  rename(Category = CATEGORY) |&gt;
  arrange(desc(`Number of Shelters`))

category_table

# A tibble: 3 × 2
  Category             `Number of Shelters`
  &lt;chr&gt;                               &lt;int&gt;
1 Adults (all genders)                   12
2 Men                                     4
3 Youth (all genders)                     1

