Shelter Locations Map
The map below shows the locations of homeless shelters in Vancouver.

map_data &lt;- shelters |&gt;
  tidyr::separate_wider_delim(
    geo_point_2d,
    delim = ", ",
    names = c("latitude", "longitude")
  ) |&gt;
  mutate(
    latitude = as.numeric(latitude),
    longitude = as.numeric(longitude)
  )

leaflet(map_data) |&gt;
  addTiles() |&gt;
  addMarkers(
    lng = ~longitude,
    lat = ~latitude,
    popup = ~FACILITY
  )
